<title>USA: HFS ends talks for Montgomery Ward unit.</title>
<headline>HFS ends talks for Montgomery Ward unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said on Friday that it has terminated talks to acquire Signature Financial/Marketing Inc from bankrupt retailer Montgomery Ward &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Since Montgomery Ward filed Chapter 11 on July 7, HFS said in a statement, the parties have not been able to strike a deal that meets HFS's acquisition criteria.</p>
<p>HFS said its strategic objectives in direct marketing will be met through its pending merger with CUC International Inc.</p>
</text>
